{"product_id":"my-first-picture-dictionary-berlitz-kids-picture-dictionary","title":"My First Picture Dictionary (Berlitz Kids Picture Dictionary)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"658\"\u003eBerlitz Language: My First Picture Dictionary (Berlitz Kids Picture Dictionary) is the perfect companion for young learners taking their first steps into a new language. Filled with colorful illustrations and simple words, this dictionary makes learning fun and engaging for children. Each page introduces everyday objects, animals, and activities, helping kids build their vocabulary in an intuitive and interactive way. Ideal for parents and educators, this book encourages early language development while sparking curiosity and confidence in little learners.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"660\" data-end=\"768\"\u003eDimensions:\u003cbr data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"696\"\u003eAuthor: Berlitz\u003cbr data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"714\"\u003eISBN: 978-1780042797\u003cbr data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"737\"\u003eFormat: \u003cbr data-start=\"754\" data-end=\"757\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003ePages: 64\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45684326006937,"sku":"BLK-2-978-1780042797","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/9789812688149-es.jpg?v=1756570558","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/my-first-picture-dictionary-berlitz-kids-picture-dictionary","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}